{
  "_comment": [
    "Canonical 'all packaged software' manifest for LMDesktopPlus (Phase 4).",
    "Single source of truth for the peer software the UI drives fail-soft, the",
    "rice packages, and the vapor//matrix fonts. Consumed by:",
    "  - packaging/manifest.py (parser + CLI)",
    "  - packaging/build-deb.sh          (main lmdesktopplus Depends/Recommends/Suggests)",
    "  - packaging/build-deb-metapackage.sh (lmdesktopplus-desktop: Depends on the full set)",
    "  - packaging/freebsd metaport tooling (RUN_DEPENDS / pkg set)",
    "Fields per component:",
    "  id          stable logical name",
    "  tier        core | recommended | optional | rice | font",
    "  source      distro (from the OS package manager) | ofl-fetch (fetched font)",
    "  debian      apt dependency spec (may include a version and '|' alternates), or null",
    "  freebsd     FreeBSD pkg name, or null when not applicable to FreeBSD",
    "  archive     optional; distro archive a package is exclusive to (e.g. 'mint').",
    "              Such packages are unsatisfiable in the base Ubuntu archive the",
    "              respin bootstraps against, so they become metapackage Recommends",
    "              (still pulled on a real Mint install) instead of hard Depends.",
    "  category    grouping for humans/docs",
    "  description short human description",
    "Tier -> Debian control field for the MAIN lmdesktopplus package:",
    "  core -> Depends, recommended -> Recommends, optional -> Suggests.",
    "The lmdesktopplus-desktop metapackage Depends on every distro component",
    "satisfiable in the base archive and Recommends the archive-pinned ones (so",
    "an ISO preinstall == installing one metapackage, without a failed build)."
  ],
  "components": [
    {"id": "python3", "tier": "core", "source": "distro", "debian": "python3 (>= 3.10)", "freebsd": "python3", "category": "runtime", "description": "Python 3 interpreter for the control center"},
    {"id": "pygobject", "tier": "core", "source": "distro", "debian": "python3-gi", "freebsd": "py-gobject3", "category": "runtime", "description": "PyGObject / GObject-Introspection bindings"},
    {"id": "gtk3", "tier": "core", "source": "distro", "debian": "gir1.2-gtk-3.0", "freebsd": "gtk3", "category": "runtime", "description": "GTK 3 typelib for the native shell"},
    {"id": "webkit2", "tier": "core", "source": "distro", "debian": "gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0", "freebsd": "webkit2-gtk", "category": "runtime", "description": "WebKitGTK typelib for the embedded window (else --browser)"},
    {"id": "networkmanager", "tier": "core", "source": "distro", "debian": "network-manager", "freebsd": null, "category": "network", "description": "NetworkManager backend (Linux only)"},

    {"id": "kitty", "tier": "recommended", "source": "distro", "debian": "kitty", "freebsd": "kitty", "category": "terminal", "description": "Primary terminal used by the rice + agent sessions"},
    {"id": "rofi", "tier": "recommended", "source": "distro", "debian": "rofi", "freebsd": "rofi", "category": "launcher", "description": "Application/agent launcher"},
